      handFlatShape:'horizontal line', handLineShape:'straight line', handQuadraticShape:'quadratic curve', handFewGuideCaption:'For k={k}, the formula has degree at most {degree}. Of the candidates through the {count} selected points, the selected one is shown as a blue {shape} and others as faint guides. Each guide evaluates the coefficient representatives 0 through p−1 over the reals. A branch stops above p−1 and resumes at 0. Only points at integer x are calculated in GF(p); intermediate positions on a guide are not field values. The red point at x=0 is candidate secret s.', handEnoughGuideCaption:'For k={k}, the formula has degree at most {degree}. The recovered formula is shown with a {shape} guide. It evaluates coefficient representatives 0 through p−1 over the reals. A branch stops above p−1 and resumes at 0. Its GF(p) values are the points at integer x=0 through {max}. Blue points are the k selected shares, and the red point at x=0 is secret s={secret}. Intermediate positions on the guide are not field values.',
      handEnoughTitle:'② Select k shares: recover the secret', handEnoughPickLabel:'Select up to k shares', handEnoughIntro:'The shares from ① are selected, plus the lowest-numbered remaining share. You can choose another set. With k shares, Lagrange interpolation fixes one polynomial and recovers s at x=0.', handEnoughSelected:'Gathered shares: {shares} ({count})', handEnoughPending:'Select {missing} more shares to reconstruct.', handEnoughGraphLabel:'Values of the polynomial recovered from k shares', handEnoughGraphCaption:'These are the GF(p) values of reconstructed f(x) at integer x=0 through {max}. Blue points are the selected k shares; the red point at x=0 is secret s={secret}. There are no GF(p) values between these points.', handExploreTitle:'Explore the coordinate plane and a real-number curve', handExploreIntro:'These are extra experiments. Drag cells in the GF(p) plane to see how changing a share affects reconstruction, or compare a real-number curve. They are separate from the discrete diagrams above.',
      candidateTitle:'Candidates with k−1 shares', candidateCount:'candidate polynomials', candidateSecret:'Candidate secret', previous:'Previous', next:'Next', showAll:'Overlay all',
