      multiplication:'GF(2⁸) multiplication', multiplyIntro:'Inspect multiplication used in “Bytes” with the fixed example {57}×{13}={FE}. This example does not change with the shares or random coefficients selected in that tab. Read the eight bits of 13 from right to left; when a bit is 1, XOR the current a into the result. Shift a left each time, XORing 0x1B to reduce it if it overflows eight bits. The table shows all eight steps.',
